  "description": "<p>The minimum implementation to support Indirect Containers. </p>\n\n<p>The resolution to this ticket should include resolutions to the following Fedora API Test Suite failures, or result in the creation of appropriate follow-on tickets.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations MUST set the indirect container's ldp:membershipResource by default when not specified on creation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations SHOULD set the indirect container's ldp:membershipResource to the LDPC by default when not specified on creation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations must allow the indirect container's membership predicate to be set by default to an implementation defined value.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations should use the default &lt;&gt; ldp:hasMemberRelation ldp:member</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations must allow the ldp:insertedContentRelation property to be set by default to an implementation defined value.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpic</a><br/>\nImplementations SHOULD allow the ldp:insertedContentRelation property to be set by default to ldp:MemberSubject.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n\n<p> </p>",
